Oh, uh, I mean...

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:49.710
Really, you had to go and do something unnecessary.

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:51.790
Sorry but, I'm gonna have to get going.

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.210
My client, a certain organization...

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.000
Organization?

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:54.670
No, a city.

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:55.250
City?!

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:56.790
No, it's a country, that's it.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:57.710
Country?

00:20:57.710 --> 00:21:00.460
That's right. You see, a country is waiting for me!

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:02.420
School is waiting for you too.

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:07.210
Oh yeah. Earlier, you were saying something
about being an insignificant person, but...

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:11.330
You're at least worth the value of someone like
a knight of the Dragonia Kingdom.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.580
If you like, I could hire you.

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:43.790
Sawagashikute yakamashikute

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:47.670
Demo itoshikute

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:51.880
Ano hi no warai koe

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:55.920
Maki modesenai story

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:59.790
Seishun te yatsu wa zutto hikari to kage

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:01.830
Kurayami no naka

00:22:01.830 --> 00:22:03.880
Kagayaku rettousei

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:07.580
Furi kaereba kojiraseta

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:12.000
Utsukushi sugiru hibi

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:21.540
Itsumo haru wa fui ni toori sugita ato

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:28.630
Kimi no kotoba mune ni reverb

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:37.170
Itsuka haru ga zenbu tsure satte shimau

00:22:37.170 --> 00:22:44.830
Sono hi made wa baka de ii

00:22:45.170 --> 00:22:49.420
Kake nukeru kara

00:22:55.210 --> 00:22:57.250
Ma-ji-me!

00:22:57.250 --> 00:22:58.540
T..Tanaka-san!

00:22:58.540 --> 00:23:01.710
I hadn't given you the fried chicken thank you gift
for your notes yet, right?

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:03.460
You really don't have to worry about it.

00:23:03.460 --> 00:23:04.460
Not good!

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:06.830
But, my bad, I already ate my bento, so...

00:23:06.830 --> 00:23:09.040
I wouldn't call this a replacement for it, but...

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:10.630
"Imitation of fried chicken."

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:13.960
Huh? Majime?

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:16.000
Majime? Majime?!

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:16.960
Kikuchi.
Majime? Majime?!

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:19.380
You don't need a gaming console at school, you know.
Hey, Majime?!

00:23:19.380 --> 00:23:20.580
That'll be confiscated.

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:23.130
Ugh! This sucks!

00:23:23.330 --> 00:23:24.540
Saginomiya.

00:23:24.540 --> 00:23:27.380
There's no need for cultivated bacteria
at school, you know.

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:28.670
That'll be confiscated.

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:33.130
I don't mind, but Sensei,
please handle them with extreme caution.

00:23:33.130 --> 00:23:35.920
You see, they're troublesome bacteria,
if they're exposed to air.

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:39.500
You can have them back.
